.github
.claude
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store

bin/
dist/
**/node_modules/
ui/.vite/
internal/ui/dist/*
!internal/ui/dist/.gitkeep

docs/
demo/
sdk/
*.md
!README.md

.env
*.env
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
*.log
site/
